---
// Manifesto / Sobre — Seção emocional da marca
---

<section id="sobre" class="manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
  <!-- Background decorative element -->
  <div class="manifesto__bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="manifesto__bg-circle"></div>
    <div class="manifesto__bg-grid"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="vz-container manifesto__inner">

    <!-- Left: quote & brand story -->
    <div class="manifesto__left">
      <!-- Quote mark -->
      <div class="manifesto__quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">"</div>

      <blockquote class="manifesto__quote" cite="https://vizor.com.br">
        <p class="manifesto__quote-text">
          Quando há paixão no que se faz, o resultado é excelência. Por isso, cada detalhe
          <strong>Vizor</strong> entrega proteção e estilo com propósito.
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <div class="manifesto__attr">
        <div class="vz-divider"></div>
        <span class="manifesto__attr-text">Missão Vizor</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: company info -->
    <div class="manifesto__right">
      <p class="vz-overline" style="color: var(--vz-300);">Nossa história</p>
      <h2 id="manifesto-title" class="vz-display-m manifesto__title">
        100% Brasileiro.<br />
        <span class="manifesto__title-accent">100% Dedicado.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="manifesto__text">
        A Vizor nasceu em <strong>março de 2025</strong> da paixão por carros e motocicletas.
        Sediada em São Leopoldo, Rio Grande do Sul, nascemos com a missão de elevar o padrão
        de proteção para painéis de instrumentos no mercado nacional.
      </p>

      <p class="manifesto__text">
        Combinamos tecnologia de ponta, processos produtivos bem definidos e inovação
        contínua para entregar películas que protegem sem comprometer o visual original da sua moto.
      </p>

      <!-- Info cards -->
      <div class="manifesto__cards">
        <div class="manifesto__card">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="manifesto__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <span class="manifesto__card-label">Localização</span>
            <span class="manifesto__card-value">São Leopoldo, RS</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="manifesto__card">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="manifesto__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/>
            <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <span class="manifesto__card-label">Fundação</span>
            <span class="manifesto__card-value">Março de 2025</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="manifesto__card">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="manifesto__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <span class="manifesto__card-label">Posição</span>
            <span class="manifesto__card-value">Top fabricantes nacionais</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="manifesto__card">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="manifesto__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <span class="manifesto__card-label">Qualidade</span>
            <span class="manifesto__card-value">SGQ ativo · ISO-aligned</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    background-color: var(--vz-800);
    padding: var(--section-py) 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* BG */
  .manifesto__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .manifesto__bg-circle {
    position: absolute;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(46,139,199,0.08);
    top: 50%;
    left: -200px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .manifesto__bg-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(46,139,199,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(46,139,199,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 48px 48px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 30%, black 70%, transparent);
  }

  /* Layout */
  .manifesto__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Left */
  .manifesto__left {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
    padding-top: 24px;
  }

  .manifesto__quote-mark {
    position: absolute;
    top: -32px;
    left: -16px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 160px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: rgba(46,139,199,0.08);
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .manifesto__quote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .manifesto__quote-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .manifesto__quote-text strong {
    color: var(--vz-300);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .manifesto__attr {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .manifesto__attr-text {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  }

  /* Right */
  .manifesto__right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .manifesto__title {
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .manifesto__title-accent {
    color: var(--vz-300);
  }

  .manifesto__text {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .manifesto__text strong {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Info cards */
  .manifesto__cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .manifesto__card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .manifesto__card:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  .manifesto__card-icon {
    color: var(--vz-400);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .manifesto__card > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .manifesto__card-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--vz-400);
  }

  .manifesto__card-value {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .manifesto__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .manifesto__quote-mark { font-size: 120px; }
    .manifesto__cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .manifesto__cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
